		<profileDesc>
			<abstract>
				<div xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0"><p><s coords="1,72.0,300.1,450.2,9.0">We study how attention heads specialise during pre-training <ref type="bibr" target="#b0">[1]</ref>.</s><s coords="1,72.0,311.1,450.2,9.0">A small subset of heads accounts for most downstream gains.</s></p></div>
			</abstract>
		</profileDesc>
